From 0d2eea4d74cc01f484b8067ab5bc16131243654f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "R. Daneel Olivaw" <rdaneel@gozala.io>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:55:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(query): declare notation/read and notation/analyze,
 their implementation supplied through the environment

The engine names them and their cells; the notation supplies the code through
Holds. A missing implementation fails the query naming it, a row breaking its
cells fails it naming the cell, and a rule holding either is refused, for now.
The test helper takes a relation, as the! takes a literal only.
